  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Repairs the existing Earthborne Rangers intake from `blocked` to `ready_for_audit` under the current additive coverage law.\n- Preserves the inherited research and evidence commits, then integrates current `origin/main` without rewriting history.\n- Adds the complete staged canonical tree with claim-level `Source / Evidence / Confidence` triplets, real evidence receipts, four reduced source-linked WebP visual references, and explicit open followups for unknown card/factual denominators.\n- Does not write `KnowledgeBase/BoardGames/games/`, `approval.json`, or promotion state.\n\n## Commit sequence\n\n- `8ffca761866cf0e739b272177ff76bca748324d6` \u2014 inherited Earthborne research packet\n- `acb4825d2f3d996dc3375f380b1554dd3b57171c` \u2014 inherited evidence-denominator repair\n- `db6d3dc` \u2014 merge current `origin/main` (`7ff610f891650615d215ce25e8e1d73a4ac82150`)\n- `fcaa69b4486b8e2be3ae18468e430e01e7004edf` \u2014 ready-packet repair\n\nPacket hash: `a72ff154c4ae47475d711012d0a97a085ab76c5a2441df95714026c16a9d38f3`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --run 2026-07-31-earthborne-rangers` \u2014 clean\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main` \u2014 clean\n- `node --test scripts/intake-lib.test.mjs scripts/validate-intake-package.test.mjs scripts/fail-closed.test.mjs scripts/validate-okf-provenance.test.mjs` \u2014 45 passed, 1 intentional skip, 0 failed\n- `node --test scripts/validate-okf-visuals.test.mjs` \u2014 5 passed, 0 failed\n- `node scripts/generate-index.mjs` \u2014 completed\n- `node scripts/generate-dawncaster-card-sidecars.mjs` \u2014 completed\n- `node scripts/validate-okf.mjs` \u2014 2637 files clean + INDEX fresh\n- `git diff --check` \u2014 clean\n- ordinary pre-commit and pre-push hooks \u2014 passed\n\n## Audit boundary\n\nThis is a normal, non-draft PR. The head is explicitly **pre-approval and ready for an independent Mennonite audit**. The Mennonite must reopen the sources, audit the packet, and author any approval/promotion transitions. Bathcat has not approved, promoted, or merged this work.\n",
  "closed_at": "2026-08-04T21:51:20Z",
